# Project: persistent vector store (rebuild from source)
rag_storage/

# Project: smoke-test residues — tests sometimes write ChromaDB / graph
# dumps under tests/_rag_storage_* (e.g. the LynxManager UI smoke runs
# that point at src/lynx itself). Big binary files, never source of truth.
tests/_rag_storage*/

# Project: user-local config (use config.example.json as template)
config.json
# Backup written by the web UI config editor on every save.
config.json.bak

# Project: smoke test artifact
_test_watch_stderr.log

# Project: local tooling binaries (downloaded, not source) — e.g. the MCP
# Registry publisher used to push server.json.
/mcp-publisher.exe

# uv-generated lockfile — deliberately untracked: the published artifact is a
# PyPI package/uv tool, so resolution happens on the user's machine; CI tests
# against fresh resolutions on purpose.
uv.lock

# Claude Code session transcripts saved into the repo root (date-prefixed).
/20??-??-??-??????-*.txt

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
benchmarks/_target/
benchmarks/_storage*/
benchmarks/results*.json
benchmarks/_*.log

# Project: private release playbook (local paths, antivirus quirks,
# credential handling). Useful to whoever publishes, not to whoever clones.
/RELEASE_PLAYBOOK.md
